  "description": "Stock Market is Pumping...we are going to ride that trend 🚂",
  "body_html": "<p>Good morning and Happy Friday. Later today after 2PM CST, 3 PM EST, if the stock market is still green, I will be purchasing another “recession resistant” stock. Bright Springs Health, <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$BTSG&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span> was our last recession stock to buy, and is currently up nearly 17% since entry, with stops in profit. </p><p>Before that though…I mentioned yesterday we needed a clear directional signal from the markets. Today we got it. The VIX made a local low, and <span class=\"cashtag-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;symbol&quot;:&quot;$SPY&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CashtagToDOM\"></span> gapped up wards. We were starting to get bullish signals around the 20th of October, today certainly confirmed that direction. </p><p>Its a great day when our longs are going up and our single short continues to go downwards! </p><p>If you missed any of these, still relevant, posts from this week, check them out when you have some time. </p><ul><li><p><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/taking-our-first-short-position?r=4z8lgl\">Taking our first short position with a GREAT company…</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stock-market-opens-way-up?r=4z8lgl\">Stock Market is Giving Bullish Signals on the 20<sup>th</sup> of October</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stocktok-market-update-october-23rd?r=4z8lgl\">Oil is a great leading indicator, locally</a></p><ul><li><p><a href=\"https://substack.com/@stocktok/note/c-169372842?r=4z8lgl&amp;utm_source=notes-share-action&amp;utm_medium=web\">Note: Oil leading indicator is bullish</a> </p></li></ul></li></ul><p>If you have questions, feel free to ping me in the chat during market hours:<em> <strong><a href=\"https://substack.com/chat/3537822\">Chat with Timothy</a> </strong></em>Also have tons of publicly available resources to help you on your investing journey: <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/\">All Publications</a><em><strong> | </strong></em><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/investing-for-beginners-10-short?r=4z8lgl\">Investing For Beginners Series</a> <em><strong>|</strong> </em><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/90-of-traders-fail-and-100-of-them?r=4z8lgl\">Tools Tim Built for TradingView</a> <em><strong>| </strong></em><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stock-screener-frequently-asked-questions?r=4z8lgl\">Stock Screener FAQ</a> <em><strong>| </strong></em><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/losers-dollar-cost-average-down?r=4z8lgl\">How to DCA UP!</a></p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><p>Now, the stock I am seeking to pick up later today is: ⬇️ </p>",
  "has_dynamic_content": false,
